      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Genetic association studies have linked genetic variants in the Selenium (Se) metabolism with the development of complex diseases such as cancer and helped unravel novel mechanisms underlying cancer development. The chapter describes the specificity of genetic variants in the Se metabolism, the approaches used in association studies, and the limitations of such approaches."},
